# Copy to .dockerignore at the repository root. It keeps the Docker build
# context to what `uv sync` needs.
# From fab-benchmark-runner's deploy/ folder, for a single-project repository.
# In a uv workspace, also allow each member's pyproject.toml, README.md and src/.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!deploy/
deploy/*
!deploy/Dockerfile
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
